   "cooked": "<p><strong>This is where the forked param choices posts will be collected and observed by the community</strong></p>\n<p>Posts will not be opinionated but just arbitrary to the Params selected and why</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>It is not a place denounce peoples posts or choices</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>It also not a popularity contest.  You can use your votes to support the choices you like</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Once posts have been established and submitted the contributors will be expected to use Token Log to vote</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The comment section of post’s can be utilized for opinions and questions</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
